  {
    "name": "list_agents",
    "methods": ["agent.list.request"],
    "description": "List compact agent snapshots, newest first. limit defaults to 50. nextCursor continues the directory. Internal Bot sessions remain private. Where only the agents of this conversation's own tasks are reachable, the newest 200 agents are read and filtered, nextCursor is null and truncated says whether the list is incomplete.",
